--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Descript Audio Codec (DAC), 44.1 kHz — MIT License, © Descript, Inc.
  Fetched by `make dac` via `dac.utils.download()`; installed as the
  `descript-audio-codec` PyPI package.
  Source: https://github.com/descriptinc/descript-audio-codec
  Used frozen: encoder produces the RVQ training targets, decoder reconstructs
  the waveform at inference. Its weights are not modified by training.

DNSMOS P.835 — Microsoft DNS-Challenge repository (see that repository for its
  license terms).
  Fetched by `make dnsmos` from the Microsoft DNS-Challenge repository.
  Source: https://github.com/microsoft/DNS-Challenge
  Used for evaluation only (`make eval`); not part of the trained model.

Whisper (`tiny.en`, optional) — MIT License, © OpenAI.
  Pulled by the in-training CER eval when `eval.cer.enabled` is set. The eval is
  run through faster-whisper (below), not the reference OpenAI implementation.
  Source: https://github.com/openai/whisper

